Scope notes

Code: all source in this repository is covered by the MIT terms above.

Data: every dataset shipped here is synthetic, generated by
slicktrace_core/synth_generator.py and slicktrace_core/detection_data.py, and carries
no third-party terms. Each case manifest records this in its `data_licence`
field. No Zenodo, Danish Maritime Authority, NOAA, Global Fishing Watch or
Copernicus data is included in this repository, and none has been retrieved.

If real data is added later, it does NOT inherit these terms. Each source must
be recorded separately with its own licence, redistribution status, required
attribution string and any access constraints, per masterplan Appendix B, and
redistribution inside a container image must be checked before the incident
capsule ships anything but a fetch script.

Dependencies retain their own licences; see requirements.txt and
frontend/package-lock.json.
